  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harvest Money Expo 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Harvest Money Expo is an annual agricultural expo in Uganda.Each year the Netherlands hosts the Netherlands Village on this expo and organises an outgoing trade mission with Dutch businesses to strengthen the bilateral agricultural trade between the Netherlands and Uganda and to promote local private sector development.This project helps to facilitate the organisation and logistics of the Netherlands Village and the trade mission.</narrative>
  </description>
